{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q14", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主的婚恋和子女情况？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字分析：己土日主生于辰月，年柱癸亥，时柱丁卯。日支与时支双卯为七杀，月干丙火、时干丁火印星化杀生身，为杀印相生格。男命以七杀为子星，时柱子女宫双卯木七杀强旺，预示子息较多，很可能有儿子。原局正官（女星）藏于年支亥中不显，力量较弱。\n\n大运癸丑（25-34岁），2011辛卯年，辛金食神透干制杀，食神引动子女，地支卯木七杀（子星）伏吟妻宫与子女宫，且卯到即为子星到，有奉子成婚之象；流年干支辛卯，食神为应期，婚事与孕事同至。2012壬辰年，辰中藏乙木七杀，顺利得一子。2015乙未年，乙木七杀透干坐未库，再得一子。妻宫七杀坐守，印星化杀，夫妻关系平淡但稳定。与选项B描述高度契合。\n\n其他选项分析：A女星力量弱且2014甲午透官合身虽有得女可能，但原局子星更强，头胎生女概率较低；C、D无婚无子明显不符原局财官杀结构。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q14", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 85531, "response_id": "8dbccea4-9cb5-46cf-8200-8daf3eb2a805", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 269, "completion_tokens": 5549, "total_tokens": 5818, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 256}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 5238}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 256, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 13}}
{"case_id": "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q15", "domain": "unknown", "question": "2022年，命主发生的重要事件？", "expected_answer": "A", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "### 推理分析\n\n1. **八字排盘**  \n   命主四柱：癸亥年、丙辰月、己卯日、丁卯时。  \n   日主己土生于辰月，虽为湿土得微根，但全局木旺（卯木当令，年支亥、日时双卯），杀强身弱。喜火土为用，忌水木。月干丙火正印、时干丁火偏印，双印透干化杀生身，为命局关键用神。\n\n2. **大运与流年**  \n   大运壬子（35-44岁），流年壬寅（2022年）。壬子运水旺财星，流年壬寅又透壬水，财星极旺。地支寅卯辰三会东方木局，官杀攻身日主。天干两壬水合丁火、冲丙火，壬丁合木、丙火受群水所克，用神印星被全面摧毁。印星代表母亲、房产、健康庇护，财旺坏印，尤其正印丙火受克无救，主母亲有生死大灾。\n\n3. **事件推断**  \n   流年丁火偏印被壬水合化，丙火正印遭壬癸水围克，印星尽失，母亲难保。同时，官杀会局攻身、财多身弱，虽可应疾病或破财，但“印星全灭”的凶象更为突出，母亲去世的信号最强。其余选项虽有部分信息重叠，但印星彻底受克是此年命局最核心的克应点，故优先选取A项。\n\n### 最终答案\n最终答案：A", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "miyazaki_male_19830421_P003-Q15", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1\\details_2025_b1a_prime_R2_P3_G1.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 38272, "response_id": "44b47676-940e-48d0-ad8e-e807010e1f61", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 239, "completion_tokens": 2356, "total_tokens": 2595, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 1983}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 111}}
